# Keep generated dependencies and disposable tooling out at every nesting level.
**/node_modules/
**/.npm/
**/.cache/
/test/scratch/

# Review evidence allowlist: seven files, combined budget 512 KiB (README).
!artifacts/
/artifacts/*
!/artifacts/validation.md
!/artifacts/design-probe.json
!/artifacts/render-evidence.json
!/artifacts/setup-desktop.png
!/artifacts/setup-mobile.png
!/artifacts/setup-mobile-demo.png
!/artifacts/overlay-1280.png
